{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":74856,"duration_api_ms":71909,"num_turns":20,"result":"","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"75f4c119-f3da-4c57-9467-ca24a97edf58","total_cost_usd":0.77593975,"usage":{"input_tokens":10,"cache_creation_input_tokens":66965,"cache_read_input_tokens":552017,"output_tokens":3254,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":66965,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":10,"outputTokens":3254,"cacheReadInputTokens":552017,"cacheCreationInputTokens":66965,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.77593975,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"structured_output":{"evidence":["All 6 acceptance-criteria tests pass in tank_data: test_provenance_schema_roundtrip (AC1), test_provenance_optional_fields (AC2), test_confidence_levels_enum (AC3), test_valid_range_enforcement (AC4), test_backward_compatible_loading (AC5), test_provenance_display (AC6).","11 provenance unit tests pass in tank_core covering ConfidenceLevel roundtrip, unknown rejection, ParamMeta display (full and empty), range check (in-range, out-of-range, no-range, non-finite value, invalid range), and format_param (with and without notes).","NaN/non-finite guard implemented in check_param_range (provenance.rs:140-146): non-finite values now produce a warning with distinct 'non-finite' message. Inverted range guard at provenance.rs:133-139 catches lo > hi with 'invalid valid_range' message. Both have dedicated tests.","Legacy total-style normalization implemented via provenance_value() -> normalize_process_param_for_provenance() pipeline (presets.rs:535-542, 796-806). All legacy _mg parameters (aob_k_tan_mg, decomposer_k_doc_mg, etc.) are divided by LEGACY_KINETIC_REFERENCE_VOLUME_L before display/range-check. preserve_non_finite_division() (presets.rs:853-858) retains NaN/inf for diagnostic paths. Covered by test_process_preset_format_param_normalizes_legacy_total_units.","Preset-level Provenance.confidence documented as intentionally freeform (presets.rs:18-20 doc comment), distinct from per-parameter ParamMeta.confidence which uses the validated ConfidenceLevel enum. Covered by test_preset_level_provenance_confidence_is_freeform.","death_biomass_to_detritus_fraction and all 4 microfauna routing fractions now present in ProcessParamsPreset struct (presets.rs:381-401) with serde defaults, included in param_value() lookup (presets.rs:514, 521-530), and tested in test_backward_compatible_loading (presets.rs:1488-1492).","ProcessParamsPreset::validate() rejects unknown param_meta keys (presets.rs:862-869). ParamMeta uses #[serde(deny_unknown_fields)] (provenance.rs:40). Both guard against typos/invalid metadata.","All public types properly exported: tank_core::types::mod.rs re-exports ConfidenceLevel, ParamMeta, RangeWarning, check_param_range, check_all_ranges, format_param. tank_data::lib.rs re-exports the same for external consumers.","Full test suite green: 45 tank_core lib + 16 tank_data lib + 3 tank_scenarios lib + 13 budget_helpers + 24 budget_tracking + 16 shrimp_population = 117 tests, 0 failures."],"findings_or_gaps":["No TOML data files currently contain [param_meta.*] sections — the provenance infrastructure is ready but actual metadata attachment is deferred to the downstream bead tanksim-6e5.7.2. This is expected per the project design.","Preset-level Provenance.confidence remains Option<String> rather than Option<ConfidenceLevel>. The distinction is now documented in a doc comment (presets.rs:18-20), which satisfies the amendment requirement for explicit documentation of the intentional divergence.","The valid_range check at presets.rs:1412 asserts warnings[0].value == 10.0 for a raw aob_k_tan_mg of 200.0 — this is correct because the legacy normalization divides by 20.0 (LEGACY_KINETIC_REFERENCE_VOLUME_L), yielding 10.0. The test correctly validates that range checks operate on normalized values, not raw stored values."],"follow_up_or_amendments":[],"outcome":"approved"},"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"eb82502a-d9f5-4ddd-91fc-61981bec92d8"}
